---
---

<section id="technique-section" class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto py-16 px-4 border-t border-neutral-900">
  <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12 space-y-3">
    <h2 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400">Breathing Mechanics</h2>
    <h3 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
      How Wim Hof Breathing Works
    </h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-neutral-400">
      Master the 3-phase sequence. Controlled deep breathing increases cellular oxygenation, sharpens focus, and calms the nervous system.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">
    <!-- Phase 1 Card -->
    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-950/60 backdrop-blur-md relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition-all duration-300">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-sm">
        01
      </div>
      <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Phase 1: Guided Breathing</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Take 30 deep, rhythmic breaths. Inhale deep and relaxed. Exhale naturally without forcing all the air out.
      </p>
      <ul class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 space-y-1">
        <li>• 30 Breaths Total</li>
        <li>• 90s Duration</li>
        <li>• Smooth & Continuous</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Phase 2 Card -->
    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-950/60 backdrop-blur-md relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-blue-500/40 transition-all duration-300">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-sm">
        02
      </div>
      <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Phase 2: Breath-Out Hold</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        After the 30th exhale, stop and hold your breath on empty. Relax completely. Never force the hold beyond a comfortable limit.
      </p>
      <ul class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 space-y-1">
        <li>• 60s – 180s Duration</li>
        <li>• Relaxed Retention</li>
        <li>• Mindful Awareness</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Phase 3 Card -->
    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-950/60 backdrop-blur-md relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-purple-500/40 transition-all duration-300">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-sm">
        03
      </div>
      <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Phase 3: Recovery Breath</h4>
      <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        When you feel the urge to breathe, take one full deep inhale and hold for 15 seconds, then exhale naturally.
      </p>
      <ul class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 space-y-1">
        <li>• 1 Deep Inhale</li>
        <li>• 15s Hold Time</li>
        <li>• Resets Next Round</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Breathing Pace Progression Explanation -->
  <div class="mb-12 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-950/60 backdrop-blur-md">
    <h4 class="text-sm font-mono text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Breathing Pace Progression</h4>
    <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      The guided breathing rhythm naturally accelerates across rounds. This progression helps you ease into the practice while building intensity.
    </p>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <!-- Round 1 -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900/50 border border-neutral-800">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/30">Round 1</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400">Slow & Relaxed</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-white">Inhale: 2.5s • Exhale: 1.5s</strong> (4s total cycle)
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 mt-1">
          Establish a comfortable rhythm. Fill the belly first, then the chest, while remaining calm and controlled.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Round 2 -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900/50 border border-neutral-800">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/30">Round 2</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400">Slightly Faster</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-white">Inhale: 2s • Exhale: 1s</strong> (3s total cycle)
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 mt-1">
          Maintain full inhales and relaxed exhales while increasing the rhythm naturally.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Rounds 3+ -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900/50 border border-neutral-800">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 border border-purple-500/30">Rounds 3–5</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400">Fast & Rhythmic</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-white">Inhale: 1.5s • Exhale: 1s</strong> (2.5s total cycle)
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 mt-1">
          Keep every inhale full and every exhale relaxed without forcing. The goal is a smooth, continuous rhythm rather than shallow or rushed breathing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Custom Sessions Note -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900/50 border border-neutral-700/50">
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-amber-400">Custom Sessions:</strong> Override the default progression by setting your own <strong class="text-white">Breath Time</strong> (2–6 seconds per cycle) in the Custom Session settings. This applies the same timing to all rounds.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Benefits Banner -->
  <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 bg-gradient-to-r from-neutral-950 via-neutral-900 to-neutral-950">
    <h4 class="text-sm font-mono text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Proven Practitioner Benefits</h4>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-300">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
        Deep Nervous System Relaxation
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-400"></span>
        Enhanced Mental Focus
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
        Stress Resilience
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-pink-400"></span>
        Greater Body Awareness
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
